# data/ — Secure File Vault
#
# This directory stores uploaded offer PDFs and any other binary assets.
# It is created automatically at application startup by main.py.
#
# SECURITY RULES (enforced by Python, never the LLM):
#   - Files are stored with UUID-based names (original filename is NOT used).
#   - SHA-256 hash is computed on upload and stored in the DB for tamper detection.
#   - Files are never served directly — always via a signed, time-limited URL.
#   - This directory must be excluded from version control (.gitignore).
#   - In production, replace with an object store (S3, GCS, Azure Blob).
